WEBVTT

00:11.260 --> 00:14.740
Today's a day off,
and the gang is out having fun.

00:20.270 --> 00:23.000
Hmm? Is it happening now?

00:23.380 --> 00:28.100
Are we meeting a new soulmate
right at the start of the episode?

00:36.050 --> 00:37.420
Apparently not.

00:37.850 --> 00:40.100
And the reason for that?

00:40.740 --> 00:42.850
Yay!

00:43.470 --> 00:48.360
Today's a group karaoke date episode!

01:04.750 --> 01:09.960
(The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You)

01:10.790 --> 01:13.630
(Karane
as the Tsundere Princess)

01:13.630 --> 01:15.920
(Demonstration
Tea-Time Prep)

01:15.920 --> 01:17.510
(Hakari
Suggestive Weight-Loss Running)

01:17.510 --> 01:18.760
(Kurumi
Ate all of the school store's bread)

01:18.760 --> 01:20.260
(Mimimi
(Getting ready) Two hours later)

01:21.430 --> 01:23.970
(Nano
Robot that exercises for her)

01:23.970 --> 01:26.390
(Shizuka
Has 365 book recommendations this week)

01:26.390 --> 01:28.690
(Kusuri
Has newly developed drug
that gives you sweet dreams)

01:28.690 --> 01:29.350
(Hahari
Chairperson's Address "Education" and "Love")

01:29.350 --> 01:30.020
(Iku
Has been doing push-ups since yesterday)

01:30.020 --> 01:31.560
(Meme
Customized Plushy- Rentaro-kun)

01:31.690 --> 01:36.400
(Rentaro-kun Appreciation Opening)

01:39.150 --> 01:40.820
(Meme-san added ears
and a tail for you!)

01:46.450 --> 01:48.500
(Rentaro-kun (& Others) Appreciation Opening)

02:21.390 --> 02:25.560
'Cause it's my destiny
to rid the world of insanity!

02:25.560 --> 02:30.810
Now the time has come.

02:30.810 --> 02:32.670
So cool, Karane!

02:32.670 --> 02:40.520
Sha-ra-ran, I want to give you
everything of mine.

02:40.520 --> 02:42.260
Pit-cheon-cheon wave!

02:42.260 --> 02:47.360
Forget the midsummer sun.

02:47.360 --> 02:53.270
I want you to burn me up...

02:53.270 --> 02:57.580
Enveloping you with a sweet scent...

02:57.930 --> 03:01.990
I'll lead you to heaven, my cutie.

03:01.990 --> 03:04.280
Great eater, hungry Jesus!

03:04.280 --> 03:09.470
Devour everything in this world...

03:09.830 --> 03:13.460
From the land of ice, Pe-Pen-Pen.

03:13.460 --> 03:16.880
In search of fishies, Pe-Pen-Pen!

03:18.590 --> 03:21.000
"As the stars in the sky shine uneven..."

03:21.530 --> 03:23.550
"Unable to bear it, I close my eyes."

03:23.870 --> 03:26.060
So accurate, Nano!

03:26.060 --> 03:30.580
I was born to obedience, to die for you.

03:30.580 --> 03:32.480
So stylish, Mei-san!

03:34.860 --> 03:38.030
"So many songs, I cannot choose."

03:38.300 --> 03:40.570
Such a voracious reader, Shizuka-chan!

03:41.220 --> 03:45.530
Feeling the gentle breeze on my cheek...

03:50.820 --> 03:54.710
With a light step
under the sunlight filtering through...

03:54.710 --> 03:56.370
Surprise hngh attack!

03:56.370 --> 03:57.690
Oh, sorry.

03:57.690 --> 04:01.490
I came to get a drink
and overheard you singing.

04:01.490 --> 04:02.590
"Pay me no mind."

04:03.480 --> 04:04.840
"I apologize."

04:04.840 --> 04:07.350
"You looked out for me, and yet I..."

04:07.660 --> 04:09.600
Huh? Oh...

04:10.320 --> 04:13.580
Shizuka-chan, are you okay
with going to karaoke?

04:13.580 --> 04:15.810
If you don't want to...

04:15.810 --> 04:17.210
"Fret not."

04:17.210 --> 04:20.110
"Come with a singing function installed."

04:20.750 --> 04:24.610
I have heard of people who have
difficulty speaking but can sing.

04:25.180 --> 04:27.160
But I never want to pressure her.

04:27.950 --> 04:32.120
"However, I have never sung
in front of others before."

04:32.120 --> 04:36.250
"My singing may lead
to a disastrous situation."

04:37.490 --> 04:38.920
"That scares me."

04:40.850 --> 04:41.920
Don't worry about it.

04:42.420 --> 04:46.590
As long as you're having fun,
you don't have to force yourself to sing.

04:46.590 --> 04:48.430
All of us feel the same way.

04:50.010 --> 04:50.910
But...

04:51.970 --> 04:56.690
If you do feel like singing, you also
don't have to force yourself not to.

05:01.950 --> 05:06.200
I'd never even thought about
whether I wanted to sing.

05:07.460 --> 05:10.450
What do I want to do?

05:10.990 --> 05:14.960
Karaoke isn't about singing perfectly.
It's about having fun doing it.

05:15.470 --> 05:20.200
Humming's an option, or you could take
a second mic and duet with someone, too.

05:26.280 --> 05:28.760
You two are mind-numbingly cute!

05:28.760 --> 05:32.220
If I'm singing not in front of "others,"
but in front of the family,

05:33.060 --> 05:34.480
then just maybe...

05:35.910 --> 05:42.190
Cuteness-Boosting Medicine I set up
in the room about to reach max potency.

05:42.520 --> 05:47.450
Kusuri-senpai's singing
is the cutest in the world!

05:47.700 --> 05:49.410
Kusuree-hee!

05:50.110 --> 05:52.580
Okay, who's next?

05:54.510 --> 05:57.250
Huh? It's Shizuka, aye?!

05:57.250 --> 05:58.710
Shizuka-chan!

05:59.230 --> 06:01.170
I wonder how she sounds...

06:08.930 --> 06:20.900
Walking hand-in-hand,
together with the people I love

06:26.930 --> 06:28.680
They were blown away
by her sheer cuteness!

06:28.680 --> 06:29.530
H... Hahari-sama!

06:29.540 --> 06:30.970
- She's a goner!
H... Hahari-sama!

06:30.970 --> 06:32.500
Forget about her!

06:38.850 --> 06:40.500
She's unbelievably cute.

06:40.500 --> 06:41.730
I can feel myself fading...

06:41.730 --> 06:44.590
Hang in there, Nano!
I'll keep you up with a butt-smack!

06:44.590 --> 06:46.110
Where'd you pull that from?!

06:46.110 --> 06:47.610
It's the best option currently.

06:47.610 --> 06:48.590
Is it?

06:48.590 --> 06:49.970
Do it, Sutou Iku.

06:50.300 --> 06:51.430
Glad you asked!

06:53.950 --> 06:54.720
Ouchy!

06:55.640 --> 06:57.860
An automated defense system!

06:58.490 --> 06:59.520
Sutou Iku!

06:59.520 --> 07:01.900
It's okay. That was a beautiful swing.

07:05.240 --> 07:07.030
That's it. I can't take any more.

07:07.560 --> 07:10.670
Yoshimoto Shizuka.
I must tell you that I...

07:11.890 --> 07:13.120
Nano!

07:14.130 --> 07:16.210
Gah! The chorus!

07:16.210 --> 07:18.080
How incredibly charming.

07:18.650 --> 07:21.040
But with Hahari-sama gone...

07:23.540 --> 07:26.800
We don't have the ability
to take this powerful chorus!

07:26.800 --> 07:27.920
Not for long!

07:28.190 --> 07:28.800
Mei?!

07:28.800 --> 07:31.760
It is a maid's duty to protect
all that her master holds dear!

07:31.760 --> 07:33.470
You can't tank it for us!

07:47.460 --> 07:49.230
Wh-What is this?

07:58.290 --> 08:02.500
Is this the world as seen
through Hahari-sama's eyes now?

08:08.740 --> 08:09.760
Mei!

08:09.760 --> 08:11.760
I have glimpsed into the promised land!

08:12.410 --> 08:15.310
Damn it, to hell with cute.

08:15.310 --> 08:16.760
To hell with smol floof.

08:16.950 --> 08:19.300
And you call yourself a high-schooler?

08:19.300 --> 08:21.600
Every single moment, every single day...

08:21.600 --> 08:23.900
I keep wanting to pet you, damn it!

08:23.900 --> 08:25.100
What're you even snapping at?!

08:25.100 --> 08:26.770
What am I supposed to do?!

08:26.770 --> 08:28.580
How could I possibly pet an older girl

08:28.580 --> 08:30.330
on the head? That'd be so rude!

08:30.330 --> 08:32.640
Not really? It's not like Shizuka'd mind.

08:32.640 --> 08:34.030
Oh, for...

08:34.030 --> 08:36.110
I just wanna gobble her up.

08:36.780 --> 08:37.970
Kurumi!

08:37.970 --> 08:39.180
Last resort.

08:39.180 --> 08:41.100
Gotta stop listening.

08:41.100 --> 08:42.160
What's that drug?

08:42.510 --> 08:44.360
Ear-Disintegrating Medicine.

08:44.360 --> 08:45.960
No! Our bodies are a temple!

08:45.960 --> 08:49.090
That doesn't sound reversible
with the Reversing Medicine.

08:49.090 --> 08:52.850
Oh, right! Could just take
Reversing Medicine, aye!

08:52.850 --> 08:56.510
Caused this with one of my drugs!

08:56.510 --> 08:58.350
Our bodies were in wonderland!

08:58.350 --> 09:01.150
Sorry, aye! Take medicine quick!

09:01.150 --> 09:01.930
Brace yourself!

09:06.180 --> 09:07.350
This is...

09:16.730 --> 09:19.200
Second... chorus.

09:19.940 --> 09:21.370
Kusuri!

09:21.370 --> 09:23.370
And the Reversing Medicine!

09:24.750 --> 09:28.240
We're the only ones left standing...

09:28.240 --> 09:29.460
What do we do?

09:29.460 --> 09:31.960
Don't just use me as your meat shield!

09:31.960 --> 09:37.150
At this rate, I'll have to have
your babies instead of Rentaro-kun's.

09:37.150 --> 09:39.440
I'm a girl! I'm gonna have babies too!

09:39.440 --> 09:40.900
Huh? Mine?

09:40.900 --> 09:42.470
Rentaro's, obvious—

09:44.430 --> 09:46.920
Did you hear that, Rentaro-kun?

09:46.920 --> 09:50.190
Karane-san said she wants
to have your babies!

09:56.530 --> 09:58.540
And in the meantime...

09:58.540 --> 09:59.660
The big chorus!

09:59.970 --> 10:01.160
Karane-san...

10:01.160 --> 10:03.620
You'll remain in my heart
as long as I live.

10:08.860 --> 10:11.540
Yes! I survived the last chorus!

10:11.540 --> 10:12.540
I'm in the clear!

10:15.880 --> 10:18.680
The chorus repeats?!

10:31.820 --> 10:34.120
If Shizuka-chan finishes singing

10:34.120 --> 10:37.440
and sees this disaster,
she'll be distraught!

10:37.840 --> 10:40.320
A boyfriend who can't handle
his girlfriend's singing...

10:40.580 --> 10:42.110
is no boyfriend at all!

10:44.060 --> 10:48.410
I have to reduce the cuteness exposure.

10:48.410 --> 10:55.070
But it'd be unacceptable to cover my ears
or make a fuss while she's singing!

10:55.500 --> 10:56.460
In that case...

11:00.790 --> 11:05.950
I love you always and forever

11:07.040 --> 11:08.130
Duet time!

11:08.130 --> 11:12.360
This way, my own voice in my head
will drown out the outside noise.

11:36.420 --> 11:37.880
Death by sweetness!

11:38.750 --> 11:41.630
Boss! Girls from the sky!

11:51.790 --> 11:55.020
But someone else caught them!

11:58.020 --> 12:01.520
No wonder everyone was
talking about how beautiful it was.

12:01.520 --> 12:03.460
I'm glad I came to check it out.

12:03.460 --> 12:05.780
We should make plans to come together.

12:06.040 --> 12:07.780
Sigh...

12:08.170 --> 12:09.710
Is this it?

12:10.140 --> 12:12.910
I am far more beautiful.

12:13.370 --> 12:15.170
Wh-What's with her?

12:16.470 --> 12:18.130
May I ask what it is you're staring at?

12:18.130 --> 12:20.200
Did my beauty happen to entranc—

12:22.750 --> 12:24.300
There we go!

12:24.300 --> 12:27.810
We got our soulmate this time!

12:29.880 --> 12:31.680
Sh-She's...

12:32.110 --> 12:33.280
A soulmate?

12:38.910 --> 12:40.300
Congratulations!

12:40.300 --> 12:43.700
I shall bestow upon you
the privilege of going out with me!

12:44.050 --> 12:49.710
You may rejoice! It is an absolute
honor to become my lover!

12:49.710 --> 12:51.330
What is with her?!

12:51.330 --> 12:53.810
U-Uh, w-wait, I...

12:53.810 --> 12:54.330
Oh!

12:54.830 --> 12:56.660
Where are my manners?

12:56.660 --> 13:00.700
I am a second-year at
the Ohana-no-Mitsu University High School.

13:01.040 --> 13:03.310
My name is Utsukushisugi Mimimi.

13:03.310 --> 13:05.090
Literally Beautiful Beautbeautbeaut!

13:05.470 --> 13:06.590
Huh? Wait...

13:06.980 --> 13:09.240
I-I go to Ohana High too.

13:09.240 --> 13:11.380
I'm Aijo Rentaro, a first-year.

13:11.380 --> 13:14.270
Ah, so you're walking the trail I blaze.

13:14.270 --> 13:17.200
I must say, however, that I envy you.

13:17.200 --> 13:18.090
Huh?

13:18.090 --> 13:23.500
Oh, such a shame it is that
I cannot date myself and all my beauty!

13:23.500 --> 13:25.540
She's a narcissist?!

13:25.540 --> 13:29.720
I mean, you are very beautiful,
but slow down.

13:29.720 --> 13:30.980
Mm.

13:32.070 --> 13:37.340
Unfortunately, Aijo-kun, your appearance
does not befit a knockout such as myself.

13:37.340 --> 13:38.000
What?

13:38.000 --> 13:40.140
But worry not!

13:40.140 --> 13:42.820
I shall make you beautiful too!

13:42.820 --> 13:44.380
Are you even listening to me?

13:44.380 --> 13:47.500
I am an expert in all matters
pertaining to beauty.

13:47.500 --> 13:50.140
A-Again, please listen to me!

13:50.560 --> 13:52.380
All in a day's work, I must say.

13:58.140 --> 14:01.210
Oh, you cut a beautiful sight!

14:01.210 --> 14:03.650
Silver hair and red eyes?

14:05.350 --> 14:06.800
Just like Nano.

14:07.150 --> 14:09.160
Beautiful is right, then!

14:09.980 --> 14:11.660
Here is your bill.

14:12.470 --> 14:14.850
Th-That's a lot of yennies.

14:14.850 --> 14:19.500
Allow me. I spare no expense
when it comes to beauty.

14:19.500 --> 14:21.290
N-No, it's fine.

14:21.820 --> 14:25.680
I mean, the girls might think
I look good like this!

14:30.760 --> 14:35.210
Chewing tapioca improves facial muscle
tone and improves your beauty.

14:35.210 --> 14:37.680
Wow, I had no idea.

14:41.550 --> 14:42.830
Stare.

14:42.830 --> 14:45.140
Would you like to try
the chocolate sauce cream?

14:45.140 --> 14:45.820
Huh?

14:48.820 --> 14:51.300
A-Alas, I must refuse.

14:51.300 --> 14:55.220
Were I to spill that drink
on my beautiful garments,

14:55.220 --> 14:58.720
I might collapse, never to move again.

14:58.720 --> 15:01.330
Your clothes aren't
Anpanman's faces, you know.

15:03.860 --> 15:08.840
Is it just me, or are
a lot of people watching us?

15:09.200 --> 15:13.330
The beautiful are constantly
the center of attention.

15:13.330 --> 15:17.300
Naturally, for people are drawn to beauty.

15:17.600 --> 15:19.790
Well, I don't know about me,

15:19.790 --> 15:22.980
but you sure are beautiful,
Utsukushisugi-senpai.

15:22.980 --> 15:24.440
Mm, indeed!

15:24.440 --> 15:28.890
Uh, that reaction's more cute
than it is beautiful.

15:28.890 --> 15:33.210
But of course! Nothing in this world
is more beautiful than I...

15:35.110 --> 15:37.000
Utsukushisugi-senpai?

15:37.000 --> 15:40.600
Well, nothing is more beautiful
currently...

15:40.600 --> 15:41.500
"Currently"?

15:41.500 --> 15:47.000
Once upon a time, there was
someone who surpassed my beauty.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.200
What?!

15:48.200 --> 15:51.090
Someone more beautiful
than Utsukushisugi-senpai?!

15:51.090 --> 15:52.380
Could it be...

15:53.240 --> 15:55.140
Nano, maybe?

15:55.140 --> 15:57.260
Come on, there's no way.

15:59.620 --> 16:01.680
What's with that couple over there?

16:01.680 --> 16:04.270
Look at them basking
in the attention. Nasty.

16:04.720 --> 16:07.400
That girl doesn't even mind it.

16:07.400 --> 16:12.030
Oh, come on.
You are totally cuter than her.

16:12.030 --> 16:15.970
She's all just clothes and makeup.

16:15.970 --> 16:19.460
Must be nice to have the money
to make yourself look better than you are!

16:20.010 --> 16:20.850
What are you...

16:20.850 --> 16:23.420
Of course they envy me.

16:23.990 --> 16:27.660
Such is the fate of all of us
who decide to live in Beautyland.

16:27.660 --> 16:29.800
I think I heard a similar line
in Nausicaä.

16:29.800 --> 16:30.770
Live!

16:30.770 --> 16:32.360
I am beautiful!

16:32.360 --> 16:33.930
Princess Mononoke next?!

16:34.320 --> 16:35.930
But they're being mean.

16:36.200 --> 16:39.020
Naught but false assumptions.

16:39.020 --> 16:39.560
Huh?

16:39.560 --> 16:47.060
The money I spend on beauty
is money I earn and save up myself.

16:47.650 --> 16:51.820
Besides, beauty cannot be bought.

16:51.820 --> 16:53.950
It requires daily effort.

16:54.290 --> 16:56.040
"...indeed."

16:56.040 --> 16:57.700
"Perchance."

16:58.710 --> 17:02.270
It is a long and arduous process.

17:02.700 --> 17:07.060
Beauty is not gained.

17:07.060 --> 17:10.210
It is earned.

17:12.530 --> 17:16.360
What's more, their envy
only proves how beautiful I am!

17:16.360 --> 17:19.980
Envy is but a display
of admiration and respect!

17:19.980 --> 17:24.540
I would go as far as to say all mankind
should be envious of my resplendent beauty!

17:24.540 --> 17:26.480
Her confidence is unshakable!

17:26.480 --> 17:29.230
Wha? You pickin' a fight?

17:32.880 --> 17:34.990
Oh?

17:34.990 --> 17:40.090
I guess you saved up for ages
to get those fancy clothes.

17:40.090 --> 17:42.620
Whoops, I slipped!

17:48.120 --> 17:51.250
Whoa, we got a white knight over here.

17:56.680 --> 17:58.080
Yikes, he's trouble!

17:58.080 --> 18:01.180
Hah! Catch me if you can!

18:01.530 --> 18:04.340
Get away while I keep him distracted!

18:04.340 --> 18:06.640
Aijo-kun, why...?

18:06.640 --> 18:09.400
Huh? Oh, I wasn't even thinking.

18:09.730 --> 18:11.900
Ah, sorry.

18:12.160 --> 18:15.650
Aww, the jacket's ruined.

18:15.980 --> 18:18.910
He showed no concern for his own outfit.

18:18.910 --> 18:20.910
Hold it, ya punk!

18:22.680 --> 18:24.460
I slipped on my own drink!

18:24.460 --> 18:26.040
Instant karma!

18:26.040 --> 18:28.540
Adieu, my favorite outfit!

18:30.690 --> 18:31.290
Huh?

18:32.210 --> 18:33.040
What?

18:36.420 --> 18:40.340
Wh-Why are you helping me?!

18:40.340 --> 18:42.180
I ruined your clothes!

18:43.560 --> 18:45.850
They're just my clothes.

18:45.850 --> 18:48.810
Utsukushisugi-senpai's are fine.

18:50.290 --> 18:55.050
And I know you were just trying
to stand up for your girlfriend.

18:55.050 --> 18:58.320
I know how it feels.
I can't hate a guy for that.

18:58.320 --> 19:02.340
Whoa, truly a boyfriend among boyfriends!

19:02.340 --> 19:05.040
Sorry, I was acting so pathetic!

19:05.040 --> 19:06.760
Sorry to you too, girlfriend.

19:06.760 --> 19:08.600
I'll pay for the clothes.

19:08.600 --> 19:09.980
We apologize.

19:09.980 --> 19:12.850
I-It's okay. Apology accepted.

19:12.850 --> 19:15.230
I'll turn myself in!

19:17.650 --> 19:19.340
Utsukushisugi-senpai?

19:19.800 --> 19:23.100
You hardly need this.
You are already beautiful.

19:23.100 --> 19:25.350
Your heart is pure and beautiful!

19:25.800 --> 19:26.980
I'm terribly sorry.

19:27.380 --> 19:34.150
I once suffered the humiliation
of having my offer of friendship rejected.

19:34.150 --> 19:37.690
And I didn't want to face it again
on the chance you rejected me too.

19:37.690 --> 19:40.860
So I tried to bulldoze through
without hearing you out.

19:41.890 --> 19:43.360
I...

19:44.100 --> 19:46.650
I am in love with you, Aijo-kun.

19:46.650 --> 19:49.750
Would you please go out with me?

19:52.610 --> 19:55.750
Of course. It would be an honor to.

19:57.210 --> 20:02.510
But first, there's something
I need to tell you too.

20:02.510 --> 20:05.470
I already have nine girlfriends.

20:05.470 --> 20:07.760
Nine? Is this some kind of joke?!

20:07.760 --> 20:12.030
I-I-Is that including or excluding me?

20:12.030 --> 20:12.780
Excluding.

20:12.780 --> 20:14.400
Excluding?!

20:15.780 --> 20:18.400
That means I'll be...

20:18.400 --> 20:21.150
the beautiful round figure tenth!

20:23.910 --> 20:25.570
I am not entirely opposed to the idea!

20:25.580 --> 20:26.910
- Mm, I say!
I am not entirely opposed to the idea!

20:26.910 --> 20:30.910
Really? So you'll join the Rentaro Family?

20:30.910 --> 20:32.560
You're a family?

20:32.560 --> 20:34.000
Aijo Rentaro.

20:36.410 --> 20:38.290
Nano! Shizuka-chan!

20:38.770 --> 20:40.430
What a coincidence.

20:40.430 --> 20:43.150
Oh, wait, you said you'd be
shopping for books.

20:43.150 --> 20:45.800
"Right. A journey to the bookstore here."

20:46.280 --> 20:48.300
Let me introduce you,
Utsukushisugi-senpai.

20:48.730 --> 20:50.640
They're the girlfriends I mentioned...

20:50.640 --> 20:52.060
Eiai Nano.

20:52.060 --> 20:55.410
Huh? Y-Yeah... You know her?

20:55.410 --> 20:56.940
Boy, do I ever.

20:57.380 --> 21:03.950
It was Eiai Nano who surpassed my beauty
and humiliated me to my very core!

21:05.030 --> 21:06.820
It really was Nano.

21:07.170 --> 21:12.200
I spoiled this by always, always, always,
always, always thinking about my girlfriends.

21:12.530 --> 21:15.610
I'm so sorry, our dear viewers.

21:15.610 --> 21:16.650
I hope you'll give

21:16.650 --> 21:19.700
The 100 Girlfriends Who Really, Really,
Really, Really, REALLY Love You

21:19.710 --> 21:21.590
another chance!

21:21.960 --> 21:26.970
I refuse to be part of
any community Eiai Nano is in.

21:28.100 --> 21:32.100
And yet I cannot yield you
to her either, Aijo-kun.

21:32.680 --> 21:33.950
That leaves but one option.

21:35.980 --> 21:38.450
We must determine which of us
will leave the Rentaro Family

21:38.450 --> 21:41.110
with a Beauty Search contest!

21:41.550 --> 21:46.060
I can't say I have much hope
for this random game.

21:46.060 --> 21:49.240
Wait, leave the Rentaro Family?

21:49.700 --> 21:53.370
Oh, but there's no way
Nano will be up for this.

21:55.740 --> 21:56.540
What?

22:03.310 --> 22:04.720
Nano's...

22:05.340 --> 22:07.550
Like Clara...

22:08.750 --> 22:10.260
I will rise to your challenge.

22:14.130 --> 22:15.370
She's up for it!

22:16.030 --> 22:17.910
Sesemannano stood up for it!
